## What this covers

- `data/output/` — the 16,500 generated vignettes
- `data/personas/` — the 500 persona specifications
- `data/edge_validation_150/` — the human edge-validation study, including the
  annotations, study materials, and raw judge output
- `data/edge_probe/`, `data/llm_judge/`, `data/judge_input/`, `data/analysis/`
  — evaluation inputs, judge scores, and analysis outputs

