## Please read before using this data

The licence grants broad permission. The following are requests, not licence
conditions, and reflect the ethical position set out in the paper.

**Every vignette is synthetic.** No item in this dataset describes a real
person. If you redistribute or display this material, label it as synthetic and
as not representing a real individual. In our clinician study, full-condition
vignettes were taken to be human-written 85% of the time, so unlabelled
redistribution is likely to mislead.

**Think carefully before training clinical models on it.** A model trained on
these vignettes inherits the theoretical commitments of one cognitive model of
PTSD, the stylistic regularities of the generating models, and the demographic
composition of the persona set, which is grounded in U.S. Census categories.

**Fidelity to a cognitive model is not clinical validity.** The set does not
cover complex PTSD, comorbidity, or culturally specific presentations, and
should not be read as representing the full clinical reality of PTSD.
